 f"| header 0x38 (`hdr.u38`) | 3 in {sum(1 for r in recs if r['hdr']['u38']==3)}/{N} saves (all of player A, B, D); 0 in {sum(1 for r in recs if r['hdr']['u38']==0)}/{N} (all of player C and `me`); every save with `difficulty_clear_flag_[3]` set has 3 ({sum(1 for r in d3 if r['hdr']['u38']==3)}/{len(d3)}); every save with flag [0] set has 0 ({sum(1 for r in d0 if r['hdr']['u38']==0)}/{len(d0)}) | possibly the difficulty index of the playthrough (0 where flag [0] was set, 3 where flag [3] was set). Not independent of the uploaders' labels: **a candidate, not a result** |",
